= render 'shared/support_page', page_title: 'Software Support', current_page: 'Software Support', parent_page: true, page_subtitle: 'Community-based help for software and setup questions', document_title: 'Software Support', meta: ['Facebook community', 'Shared knowledge', 'Faster answers'], toc: support_software_toc do
  p.lead We understand that software and setup questions are just as important as hardware issues. The best way to help everyone is through our community-based approach.

  .prose.support-prose
    section#community
      .callout.info
        span.ic
          svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"
            circle cx="12" cy="12" r="10"
            path d="M12 16v-4M12 8h.01"
        div
          span.lbl Community-first approach
          p.bd We cannot help with individual setup questions one-to-one, but our community group lets everyone help each other — and documents solutions for the next person.

      .rn-subcard
        h4 Join our Facebook community
        p Our Facebook community is the primary place for software support, setup questions and general discussions about Baldrick boards.
        = link_to t('facebook_group_url'), target: '_blank', rel: 'noopener', class: 'btn btn-solid btn-sm' do
          | Join Facebook group
          span.ar →

    section#why
      h2
        span.hk
          span.bar
          span.annot Why
        | Why community support?

      .spec-grid
        .spec
          span.ic
            svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.9"
              path d="M16 21v-2a4 4 0 0 0-4-4H6a4 4 0 0 0-4 4v2M9 11a4 4 0 1 0 0-8 4 4 0 0 0 0 8z"
          h4 Benefits for you
          ul
            li Faster responses from multiple experts
            li Real-world experience from other users
            li Solutions that worked for similar setups
            li Help around the clock from builders worldwide
        .spec
          span.ic
            svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.9"
              path d="M17 21v-2a4 4 0 0 0-4-4H5a4 4 0 0 0-4 4v2M9 11a4 4 0 1 0 0-8 4 4 0 0 0 0 8zM23 21v-2a4 4 0 0 0-3-3.87M16 3.13a4 4 0 0 1 0 7.75"
          h4 Benefits for everyone
          ul
            li Solutions are shared and documented
            li Reduces duplicate questions
            li Creates a knowledge base for all
            li Helps us improve our products

    section#topics
      h2
        span.hk
          span.bar
          span.annot Topics
        | Software & setup questions

      .spec-grid
        .spec
          span.ic
            svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.9"
              path d="M9 12l2 2 4-4M22 12a10 10 0 1 1-20 0 10 10 0 0 1 20 0z"
          h4 Perfect for community help
          ul
            li xLights configuration and setup
            li Sequence creation and troubleshooting
            li Network configuration issues
            li Firmware update questions
            li Web interface problems
            li Integration with other software
            li Best practices and tips
        .spec
          span.ic
            svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.9"
              path d="M4 19.5A2.5 2.5 0 0 1 6.5 17H20M6.5 2H20v20H6.5A2.5 2.5 0 0 1 4 19.5v-15A2.5 2.5 0 0 1 6.5 2z"
          h4 Docs & fun stuff
          ul
            li = link_to 'Documentation & fun stuff', fun_stuff_path, class: 'lnk'
            li = link_to 'FAQ section', fun_stuff_faq_path, class: 'lnk'
            li = link_to 'Release notes', fun_stuff_release_notes_path, class: 'lnk'
            li = link_to 'Board documentation', boards_path, class: 'lnk'

    section#checklist
      h2
        span.hk
          span.bar
          span.annot Prep
        | Get the best help

      .callout.warn
        span.ic
          svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"
            path d="M10.3 3.9 1.8 18a2 2 0 0 0 1.7 3h17a2 2 0 0 0 1.7-3L13.7 3.9a2 2 0 0 0-3.4 0z"
        div
          span.lbl Pro tip
          p.bd
            | Before asking for help, check our
            = link_to ' Asking for Help checklist', support_asking_for_help_path, class: 'lnk'
            |  to make sure you include everything needed for a quick solution.

section.cta
  .wrap
    h2 Hardware issue instead?
    p Physical defects and warranty claims go through Christmas Triage.
    .cta-btns
      = link_to support_path, class: 'btn btn-bone' do
        | Hardware support
        span.ar →
      = link_to support_asking_for_help_path, class: 'btn btn-clear' do
        | Asking for help checklist
